WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:04.420
You're too young to be a backpacker.

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:07.290
Don't you have school, kid?

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.330
Don't worry, I have permission.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.300
Now let me show
my gratitude for the ride.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:17.100
Until we get to Tokyo...

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.010
Please look forward to it.

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.370
This is an HG Gouf, Mr. Ral!

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:00.310
That's right, Sei.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.040
The painting is great!

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:05.380
The color scheme is perfect,
and it's weathered for the desert.

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:08.820
The heat rod can also move
thanks to this lead wire.

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:10.650
Very cool!

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:16.790
This is no Best Mecha Collection, boy!
No Best Mecha Collection!

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:19.390
This Gunpla's good enough
for the toughest training!

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.800
Fight with us, Mr. Ral!

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:24.600
No thanks.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:30.540
Reiji, people don't just
build Gunpla for battles.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:34.940
Some, like my HG Gouf, are built
in order to cherish the anime world

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:37.580
and faithfully replicate it.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:42.420
Others are used to reproduce
anime scenes in diorama form,

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:46.690
or to build the mobile suit's details
according to your own interpretation.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:52.830
There are many ways
to enjoy Gunpla.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:55.560
Is it fun just building it
and looking at it?

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:56.360
Sure!

00:02:57.370 --> 00:02:59.570
With Gunpla,

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:04.270
we can expand our imagination
of the Gundam world.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.970
Oh, is that so?

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:10.480
Anyway, your HG Gouf is really good!

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:14.010
I still have plenty to learn.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:17.180
I heard a rumor that there's
an amazing builder in the Kansai region.

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:21.820
He's about the same age as you.

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:24.360
Thanks, old man!

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:27.830
Your kids will definitely
be excited to see that!

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.930
This Gunpla is really amazing...

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.800
Let me see.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:39.840
Where could you be, Sei Iori?

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:47.720
"﻿Kansai, boy, builder..."

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:51.490
There're so many.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:54.760
I wonder which are by the boy
Mr. Ral was talking about.

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:00.760
Sei, our Gunpla got damaged
in the last battle.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.600
Don't you need to repair it?

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:03.960
Don't worry.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.770
I'll have it fixed by
the quarterfinals this weekend.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:11.770
Actually I want to add something
to the Build Strike while I'm at it.

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:15.110
Because if we win at the quarterfinals,

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:18.210
our next opponent will be Yuuki.

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:21.120
I see.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:22.950
We'll finally be able to face him.

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:26.190
That Tatsuya Yuuki.

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:31.790
I'll pay him back for
the humiliation he caused us.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.230
On my family's honor.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:35.700
Let's win, Sei!

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:40.170
Hey, Reiji.
To be honest, I'm a bit worried.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.600
You saw it in the third round, right?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:47.540
Yuuki's Zaku had been tuned up.

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:53.810
When we fight with him,
he'll have upgraded it even more.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:58.920
I wonder if just fixing
the Build Strike is enough.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:03.290
C'mon! Don't be a fraidy-cat!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.660
Of course, I'll do everything I can.

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:10.400
But I feel like there's still
something missing.

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:14.030
If I look at the work of
the boy Mr. Ral talked about,

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.300
I might be able to get some hints.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:21.780
Sei, believe in yourself
and your Gunpla!

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.010
You're too confident.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:27.180
How come you're so sure of yourself?

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:30.780
Thinking about losing is pointless.

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:34.490
I'm going out.
Fix that Gunpla, will you?

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:45.630
Thank you for waiting.

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.840
Here is your Gunpla.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:49.440
Huh?

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.110
It's from that gentleman.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.220
Did you send me this Gunpla?

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.980
It's the Victory Gundam.

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:06.190
It has a sophisticated design
and a streamlined form.

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:10.320
This Gunpla is well suited
to a beauty like you.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.560
Please take it.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.330
Oh, I could never.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:17.830
I can't accept such a beautiful piece.

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:19.500
Then I'll have it!

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.170
Reiji!?

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:25.640
I spent three days building
that Gunpla to rope in girls!

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.480
Anyway, why are you here?

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:31.650
I only came here to battle with you.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:35.680
There's a guy I'd do anything to defeat.

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:36.680
Help me.

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:38.950
Is this really the time and place!?

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:41.960
Wait, Senorita? Where's the Senorita?

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:44.460
Given the atmosphere, she left.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:46.490
Oh dio mio!

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:47.800
So let's go!

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.400
What a disaster!

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:04.280
Rage on...

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:05.750
Rage on!

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:08.050
Gunpla!

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:14.150
There's no point in thinking ahead.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.090
To win the next match,

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:19.390
I have to get this machine
in top condition.

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:23.300
I finally made it here.

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:27.570
Why am I so bad with directions?

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:29.800
I'm disgusted with myself.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.410
So where's Iori Models?

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:37.680
Before that, I need to eat first.

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:40.080
Iori.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:44.890
Thanks for teaching me how to build
models the other day.

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:46.450
Did you finish it?

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:49.320
No, I'm only halfway done.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.020
I see.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:57.360
Are you worried about something?

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.000
Yeah, just a little.

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:04.040
Would you like to come over
to my restaurant?

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:07.210
Have some of my dad's sherbet.
You'll feel refreshed.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:09.210
No, I'm fine.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:12.610
I want to thank you for the Gunpla.

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:17.320
Oh no...

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:17.990
Dad?

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:20.090
China.

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:21.360
What's going on?

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:26.760
This customer wants to pay
for the shortfall with a toy.

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:28.100
What?

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.800
It's not a toy, but Gunpla.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:32.530
Please look at it.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.370
It's well made, right?

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.240
It's not like that...

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:37.910
Th-That's...!

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:44.240
It's the Extreme Gundam.
Finished to perfection...

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:47.280
Did you build this Gunpla?

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:49.850
Don't look at it so close.

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:52.490
I'm ashamed because
I built it here quickly.

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:54.620
It's far from perfect.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:57.590
You built this Gunpla here?

00:08:57.590 --> 00:09:00.160
So don't stare at it so much.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:02.430
How did you do this part?

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:12.040
Thank you for helping me out
with the manager.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:15.310
I didn't do anything.
You should thank Kousaka.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:18.350
Thank you. You saved me.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:19.450
No, it's fine.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:22.380
I'll display that Gunpla with care.

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:25.120
It isn't worth that much.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:30.320
I'm jealous that you have
such a cute girlfriend.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:33.990
What a nice person.

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:39.200
You sound like you're not from Tokyo.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:40.970
What did you come here for?

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:43.870
There is a place I want to go.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:46.240
It's a plastic model store,
called Iori Models.

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:47.980
My place?

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.640
What do you mean "my place"?

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:52.880
My family owns Iori Models.

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:58.490
Does that mean you're Sei Iori?

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.440
Yeah, I am.

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:00.450
I see. So it's you.
Yeah, I am.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:03.800
I see. So it's you.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:08.000
I've finally met you, Sei Iori!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.630
My lifelong rival!

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:13.030
My name is Mao Yasaka.

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:16.470
I won the Japanese 5th Block
of the Gunpla Battle Championship,

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:19.110
and I want to become the best
Gunpla builder in the world!

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:23.490
Sei Iori, I've got hold of you
at long last—

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:27.710
Hey, wait! Where are you going!?

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:31.120
There's no time left because
I have to look after the store...

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.250
Same here.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.490
Okay, I'll be brief.

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:36.160
My name is Mao Yasaka.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.830
I won the Japanese 5th Block
of the Gunpla Battle Championship,

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.390
and I want to become the best
Gunpla builder in the world!

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:46.200
Do you think I attract weird people?

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.300
Yeah, I think so.

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:32.450
- Are you satisfied? Let's—
- No, not yet!

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.950
I'm not finished just yet.

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:41.360
If you want to stop,
then it's a win for me!

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:44.860
You're so stubborn.

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:46.830
Sorry, I'm persistent.

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:52.830
Yeah, you sure are!

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:58.210
That's one of my strengths!

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:03.810
Wow.

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:08.150
It cleanses my soul
to see well-built Gunpla.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:09.950
Hey, China.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.350
Is that boy Sei's friend?

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:13.850
I'm not sure.

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:15.120
I see.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:17.060
They're about to become friends.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:22.400
Did you build all these Gunpla here?

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.760
Well, yeah.

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:28.940
I see. It's just as my master said.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:29.440
What is?

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:33.910
l've loved Gunpla since I was little.

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:38.080
To be honest, I thought
I was pretty special.

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:40.280
But my master...

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:50.790
It's a good piece.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.560
I could tell that at a glance.

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.200
You've improved your skills, Mao.

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:58.470
Thank you very much, Master.

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:02.500
Do you finally recognize me as
heir to the Gunpla Shingyo school?

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.470
Fool!

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:06.440
You're too complacent, Mao!

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:09.280
You think it's easy as bean-jam pie?!

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:11.810
Heir to the Shingyo school, you say?

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.480
Don't be full of yourself!

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:15.650
Master!

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:20.350
Mao, the world is huge.

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:25.490
Even I, who have mastered the Gunpla
Shingyo school, once feared a man.

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:27.190
R-Really?

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:31.500
The man's name was Takeshi Iori.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:34.630
He's the owner of Iori Models,
a plastic model shop in Tokyo.

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:38.310
Takeshi Iori...

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:42.580
And he has a son named Sei.

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:45.980
I heard a rumor that
he's as talented as you.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.180
First, go see that boy.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:52.150
Go and learn how big the world is!

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:56.060
That's why I came
all the way from Kyoto.

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:59.990
I wonder what my dad did.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:03.430
Wow, he was respected
by such a great man?

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:05.300
I'm so proud of my husband.

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:07.200
Is this where you get excited?

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:11.910
Sei, show him the talent
you inherited from your dad!

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.640
Stop it, mom.

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:15.810
There's no need for that.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:21.080
Looking at the Gunpla here,
to be honest, I was disappointed.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:21.880
What do you mean?

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:25.050
I mean exactly what I just said.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:29.920
The most important thing in the
building process is imagination.

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:31.960
All the Gunpla here lack it.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:35.860
You just built the products nicely.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:39.300
That's because they're just samples.

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:43.770
Then, can I see your real work?

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:46.770
﻿I also have one that reflects
the results of all my training.

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:49.110
Will you two play Gunpla Battle?

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:51.240
There's no need to.

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:56.950
A true builder can tell which model
is better with one glance.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:58.690
Right, Sei?

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:01.860
Okay, I'll go get it.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:06.290
I commend you for not running
away from a competition.

00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:19.040
Let's show them at the same time.

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:21.510
Alright.

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:26.080
- This is my...
- ﻿And this is my...

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.580
Build Strike!

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.420
Gundam X Maoh!

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:33.750
Th-This is...!

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:37.290
This Gunpla is...!

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:42.430
- Strong!

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:55.780
That machine is...

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:59.180
An assault type
based on the Gundam X.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:04.550
You know very well!

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:07.920
Yours is based on the Strike.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:16.030
It has a variable-output
rifle and a chobham shield.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.200
That backpack can detach
and transform, right?

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:21.940
He sees right through it. But...!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:34.250
The power isn't bad either.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:40.620
The plastic is reinforced, too.

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:43.860
Amazing. Mao's...

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:47.230
This Gunpla is amazing!

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.770
Why don't they move at all?

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:55.470
I think they're battling.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:17:00.670
Their imaginations are
making their Gunpla move.

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:03.780
Don't create distance!

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:07.080
If I do, he'll use that
reinforced satellite cannon!

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:09.680
I can tell what you're thinking!

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:19.990
Did he compress the Plavsky
particles and release them?

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.090
Unbelievable!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:24.200
Everyone can do it in
the Gunpla Shingyo school.

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:29.870
And from here, I'll show you
my Gundam X Maoh's true value!

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.870
Th-The moon is...

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:36.010
The moon is coming out!

00:17:41.820 --> 00:17:46.590
It receives super microwaves from
a power generation system on the moon.

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:48.150
And it converts them into energy.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:52.130
This is the ultimate secret
of the Gunpla Shingyo school!

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:55.260
Hyper satellite cannon!

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:25.690
How do you like my Gunpla, Sei?

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:34.270
Wh-What!?

00:18:34.970 --> 00:18:36.670
How did you dodge it!?

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:39.310
I'm impressed, Mao.

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:43.040
You're superior as a builder.

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:44.280
I admit it.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:47.980
I couldn't have dodged that attack
if it had been against me.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:52.190
But the regular pilot of
this Build Strike isn't me.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.590
It's Reiji!

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:59.690
Reiji could dodge it
and keep fighting!

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:04.000
That's enough!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.740
Let me put this match on hold.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:14.370
This battle is too good to let it
finish in your imaginations.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:20.580
You won't settle this in your heads,
but on a shining stage...

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:23.920
Yes, at the World Tournament!

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:27.390
The World Tournament...

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:33.230
I don't know who you are,
but what you said is admirable.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:36.060
Sei, lets put this on hold.

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:37.800
Mao?

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:39.670
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:43.240
I'm sure I'm better at a
Gunpla building battle.

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:48.410
But if you're saying
your Gunpla's regular pilot

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:51.680
would be able to
top my imagination...

00:19:52.810 --> 00:19:54.950
Then I definitely want to face him.

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:58.890
I think you'll be surprised.

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:04.160
I have a good story to tell my master.

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:06.230
I'll see you at the World Tournament.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:12.570
See? Just as I told you.

00:20:12.570 --> 00:20:14.570
They became friends.

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:15.840
That's right.

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.610
Mao Yasaka.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:26.510
In this country,
no, in the world,

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:29.420
there're many amazing
builders like him.

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:32.090
I want to meet more of them.

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:36.090
I want to see their Gunpla.

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:38.260
And I want to battle with them.

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:40.930
With my Gunpla.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:55.410
- ﻿Reiji!
- Alright!

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:11.820
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:14.230
Iori and Reiji won.

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:17.360
After he met with Mao Yasaka,

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:21.130
his Build Strike has
become even more perfect.

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:24.340
It's so nicely done, Sei!

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:27.040
Yeah. With this,
even if our opponent is him...

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:30.510
Just wait, Tatsuya Yuuki.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:33.910
Our Build Strike is up next!

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:08.370
<i>﻿We will now begin match four
of the quarterfinals.</i>

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:16.420
-﻿ What's up?
- ﻿I don't know.

00:23:17.180 --> 00:23:23.090
<i>﻿Player Tatsuya Yuuki has declined
to enter match four of the quarterfinals.</i>

00:23:23.090 --> 00:23:25.790
<i>﻿As a result, player Susumu Sazaki
is winner by default.</i>

00:23:26.360 --> 00:23:30.100
Y-Yes! I won!

00:23:30.100 --> 00:23:32.470
I was sure I'd lose.

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:36.470
Yuuki bowed out of the battle?

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:38.490
What's going on, Sei!?

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:38.500
Don't ask me.
What's going on, Sei!?

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:41.020
Don't ask me.

00:23:41.040 --> 00:23:42.510
But why?

00:23:44.210 --> 00:23:45.950
Tatsuya Yuuki...

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:50.880
Did he chicken out!?

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:58.880
Knowing the truth,
a boy becomes a warrior.

00:23:58.880 --> 00:24:01.200
Next episode, "A Reason to Battle".

00:24:01.200 --> 00:24:04.900
To face the true battle, fly, Gunpla!
